    "thought": "Planning tasks require generating a sequence of actions where each action's preconditions must be satisfied by prior actions and world state. The model must reason forward (does this action sequence achieve the goal?) and backward (what must be true before step N for step N+1 to succeed?). Pruning invalid plans early requires detecting constraint violations before full expansion.",
    "eval_relevance": "ALFWorld, WebArena, and agentic benchmarks evaluate plan validity end-to-end."
