  {
    "id": 15,
    "skill_domain": "Reading Comprehension Under Distraction",
    "thought": "Comprehension benchmarks embed the answer in a passage surrounded by high-similarity distractor sentences. The model must resist selecting the sentence that is most topically similar to the question and instead identify the sentence that contains the specific information requested. This is a signal-to-noise problem: semantic relevance ≠ answer content.",
