    "thought": "Temporal tasks require ordering events, computing durations, and reasoning about relative and absolute time. Hard cases: (1) events described in non-chronological narrative order, (2) relative dates ('three weeks before the meeting that followed the conference'), (3) duration arithmetic crossing month/year boundaries. The model must construct a timeline representation and query it.",
    "eval_relevance": "TORQUE, TimeQA, and timeline ordering tasks score temporal inference accuracy."
