    "thought": "Physical commonsense requires a naive physics model: objects fall, liquids flow to the lowest point, rigid objects do not deform under light pressure. Benchmarks test whether models apply these intuitions correctly in novel contexts. The failure mode is over-applying learned linguistic patterns without simulating the actual physical constraint.",
    "eval_relevance": "PIQA, PhysicalIQA, and HellaSwag measure physical world modeling."
