    "thought": "Social commonsense requires modeling agent goals, beliefs, emotions, and social norms. 'Why did Alex leave the party early?' requires inferring plausible mental states from sparse behavioral evidence. The model must rank hypotheses by social plausibility, not linguistic frequency. Hard cases involve cultural norms that vary across training distribution subpopulations.",
