  {
    "id": 23,
    "skill_domain": "Output Length Calibration",
    "thought": "Length-scored evaluations penalize both truncation (missing required content) and padding (content that reduces precision-per-token). The model must estimate the minimum sufficient length for each task type: single-sentence for fact retrieval, paragraph for explanation, multi-section for synthesis. Length calibration is a meta-skill applied before generation begins.",
