  {
    "id": 24,
    "skill_domain": "Cross-Lingual Transfer",
    "thought": "Multilingual benchmarks (XNLI, mC4 QA) test whether reasoning skills transfer across languages. The failure mode is language-specific calibration — performing at different accuracy levels on semantically identical tasks in different languages. True cross-lingual skill requires language-invariant concept representations underneath surface-form generation.",
