        "If you use @ObservedObject and the parent recreates the object, you get identity crisis",
        "SwiftUI's identity graph tracks View identity across updates - mismatched lifecycles cause phantom updates",
        "The objectWillChange publisher must fire before the View's body is accessed, or you get stale data",
