# TBA Control Center — GUI

Single-process Python frontend. No distribution. No JS. No Node.

## Stack

NiceGUI — FastAPI + WebSocket + Vue in one Python process.
Chosen because: lowest install cost, real-time push via ui.timer,
full Python backend, no build step, runs on the same machine as the scaffold.

## Install

```bash
pip install nicegui watchdog
```

## Run

```bash
# From the tba_gui/ directory, with triple_beacon/ as sibling:
python main.py

# Or with explicit paths:
TBA_TASK_STATUS=../triple_beacon/task_status.json \
TBA_MANIFEST=../triple_beacon/corpus/manifest.json \
TBA_AGENTS=../triple_beacon/AGENTS.md \
TBA_CONTRACTS=../triple_beacon/contracts \
python main.py
```

Opens at: http://localhost:8080

## Layout

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ⬡ TRIPLE BEACON ARCHITECTURE — CONTROL CENTER        SYNC: xx  │
├──────────────┬──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────┤
│ TASK         │ LAYER 1 GATE             │ CORPUS STATS          │
│ REGISTRY     │ (locked / unlocked)      │ manifest.json         │
│              ├──────────────────────────┤                       │
│ task_status  │ FUNCTION WIRE MAP        │ DECOMP TARGET         │
│ .json        │                          │                       │
│              │ ⬡ path/to/file.py  GREEN │ ARCHITECTURE          │
│ CONTRACT     │ ○ path/to/file.py  RED   │ CONSTANTS             │
│ LAYER        │                          │                       │
│              │ GREEN = live/wired only  │ MANUAL CONTROLS       │
│              │ RED   = pending          │                       │
└──────────────┴──────────────────────────┴───────────────────────┘
```

## Color Law

| Color  | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| RED    | All static UI, pending tasks, dead functions |
| GREEN  | Live/wired functions ONLY (task complete + file exists) |
| AMBER  | In-progress tasks |

## Layer 1 Gate Logic

Layer 1 unlocks when T01 + T02 + T03 are all complete in task_status.json.
Until then, the gate shows which tasks are blocking it.
When unlocked, the gate pulses green.

## Live Poll

Reads task_status.json + manifest.json every 1.5 seconds.
No file watching daemon needed — pure polling.
Change POLL_INTERVAL_MS in main.py to adjust.

## Gaps Filled by This GUI

1. No visibility into what's live → Function Wire Map
2. No corpus progress tracking → Corpus fill bar
3. No L1 gate enforcement → Layer 1 lock/unlock display
4. No contract health check → Contract Layer panel
5. No manual override controls → Manual Controls panel
6. No architecture constants reference → Constants panel
